  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding (rna_only with pca_n2000) without image modalities or fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.4849 suggests moderate baseline performance for RNA-only configurations, supported by a validation F1 score of 0.4639. The effectiveness of multimodal approaches or alternative RNA encoders remains uncertain without comparative benchmarks."
